CNA Living Rules is licensed per directory, to the extent the project holds
rights in each part:

  rules/            CC-BY-SA-4.0   see LICENSE-TEXT
  rulings/          CC-BY-SA-4.0   see LICENSE-TEXT
  data/             CC0-1.0        see LICENSE-DATA
